# Krang & Shredder: "you may cast a card exiled with Krang & Shredder" is one card, of all those it has exiled over the game. Turn 1 it enters with nothing leaving (no disappear) and exiles an Island and the
# Grizzly Bears; on turn 3 Bot1 casts Black Lotus and sacrifices it for mana, attacks, and its second exile takes Lightning Bolt. At the end step the Bears and the Bolt can both be cast, and Bot1 casts
# the Bears: the Bolt stays exiled and is not offered a second time.

